{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男星馬天宇與女演員兼製片人張萌，近日在內地綜藝《後會友期》中相隔近十年首度同框，引發網民熱議。</p><p>兩人自2016年合作電視劇《幻城》結緣，後來張萌轉型製片人向馬天宇發出邀約。</p><p>然而當時馬天宇正逢父親病重、個人狀態低谷且認為劇本不合，因而婉拒。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.852705+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T10:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"3bfcc4ad35969fb85194c78d1131b0a83abb68de134de5a1ba4f24dd65758945","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}